############################# # Exercise Group Introduction #############################
BEGIN_PGML Write an equation to model the scenario. There is no need to solve the equation.
END_PGML
###### # Body ######
BEGIN_PGML One year, the median rent for a one-bedroom apartment in a city was reported to be [`[$current]\text{.}`] This was reported to be an increase of [`[$percent]`] over the previous year. Based on this reporting, what was the median rent for of a one-bedroom apartment the previous year? Set up an equation to answer this question. There is no need to solve it.
[@KeyboardInstructions('Use [|r|]* as the variable.')@]**
[_]{$equation}{20}
END_PGML
